:"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"170"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"With a gentle appearance and slim profile, in many ways Haruka is the spitting image of his sister, as befits identical twins of the opposite sex. Personable and honest, he forges lasting friendships with remarkable ease. Haruka copes with the loss of his parents with a stout heart, burdened with the knowledge that the future of his delicate sister is dependent to his own. Yet to grasp success he believes one must acknowledge the past, and to that end searches for answers to his plight."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Nargrakhan's review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c552"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【本編の主人公】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親を事故で亡くし、双子の妹とともに「奥木染」のやってきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"苦労が絶えないが、苦笑しながらもけなげに頑張っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"都会の便利な環境に慣れていたせいか、田舎に移り住んで戸惑うことが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家事能力が低いため、妹との二人暮らしで相当苦戦している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"わがままで何もしない妹だが、それでも家族を大事にしたいと、一生懸命面倒をみる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「何とかなるって思ったけど……僕が一番不安だったのかな」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19233","sourceWorkId":"9854","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cdb5c08fd7a8d9a4553a4c2d94c76da01761a00c53ae88ff40d72cc1597a89d5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d4/d4c2ba87cfff4c2a8205f560e70ad4ef837a9ac4139a31dea96b5b784e3e4652.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c553","characterName":"春日野 穹","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"1152","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"2388"},{"characterId":"1152","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"6967"}],"egsCharacterIds":["15265"],"vndbCharacterId":"c553"},"originalCharacterName":"春日野 穹","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"205"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"152"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Cursed with illness and frailty since birth, Sora is denied a life of independence that many take for granted. Due to her poor health, she’s likened to delicate porcelain dolls, yet this angelic appearance belies a troublesome personality that’s prone to withdrawn laziness and detestation to conversation. In all honesty, Sora could care less of what others think, and would rather surf the Internet and eat instant foods, so long as Haruka is always at her side."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Nargrakhan's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c553"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【ふたごの妹】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"春日野悠とは、双子の兄妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無口、無気力、引きこもり。めんどくさがり屋で、悠に面倒ごとは任せて、全てを依存している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"色白で人形みたいな容姿は、よく人目を引く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"病気がちで、入退院を繰り返していたせいか、悠とのは体格差がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"カップ麺やジャンクフードが大好き。また、極度のネット依存症。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「…………何？」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15265","sourceWorkId":"9854","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"春日野悠とは、双子の兄妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無口、無気力、引きこもり。めんどくさがり屋で、悠に面倒ごとは任せて、全てを依存している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"色白で人形みたいな容姿は、よく人目を引く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"病気がちで、入退院を繰り返していたせいか、悠とのは体格差がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"カップ麺やジャンクフードが大好き。また、極度のネット依存症。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「…………何？」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15265","sourceWorkId":"12438","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公春日野悠的孪生妹妹。沉默寡言，弱不禁风，深居简出。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家务无能，麻烦的事情完全推给了哥哥悠。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"那犹如人偶一般的脸色，十分引人注目。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"或许是因为病弱，时常会住进医院，和悠的体格存在鲜明的反差。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"喜欢除了泡面之外的全部无营养食品，如果不注意她，可能一会就会全部吃光。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"同时，还有着很强的网络依存症。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"1152"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"152 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15265","sourceWorkId":"12438","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fd305a69407a21de7745f3ac607aa99d066e961ed38583eaec3e7bcc40dbe131.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4e/4ee6933e9f3e9267bd37f43acee1bccb52bfc2ee7664030e98fd752f848b5c29.webp","width":128,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田口宏子","creatorId":"vndb:s5","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5","name":"田口 宏子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:6967:1152:5020:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c554","characterName":"依媛 奈緒","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"14330","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"2388"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19235"],"vndbCharacterId":"c554"},"originalCharacterName":"依媛 奈緒","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1007"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"163"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Beautiful, intellectual and an amazing swimmer, Nao has an open attraction towards Haruka. As a close and trusted childhood friend, Nao was sincerely devastated when it seemed she would never see the two siblings again. Nao’s compassion and maturity projects an ambiance of sisterly love onto others, though for Haruka there is an intimately deeper and sensual emotion. Sora harbors great resentment towards the popular student, never taking an effort to explain the reasons why."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Nargrakhan's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c554"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【幼馴染のおねえちゃん】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の１コ上の先輩。水泳部に所属。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼少の頃、夏休みの間だけ遊びに来ていた近所のお姉さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"常に悠たちのことを気にかけてくれていて、困っているところを助けてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ノリも良く、昔と変わらない優しさでいてくれているが……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"家にいるのが苦手で、いつも外をぶらついている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「今度は……ずっと、ココにいてくれるんだよね？」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19235","sourceWorkId":"9854","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"穗见学园高中二年级，在悠小时候照顾过他的邻居的大姐姐。与悠分别后一直处于闷闷不乐的状态。擅长料理、裁缝等家事，借着参加学校的游泳部，不返家在学校看书。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"14330"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cff19c5567fb21194ac6c5f091a6ef8725da82a7a32cd2de3c0ecbaafb74c75b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/51/517190b39bc5689cefe10929a904e5048ef2dbbd979cb55ee01e77e4f087a132.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"木村 あやか","creatorId":"vndb:s590","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s590","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s590","name":"いのくち ゆか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:15397","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c555","characterName":"天女目 瑛","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"14329","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"2388"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19234"],"vndbCharacterId":"c555"},"originalCharacterName":"天女目 瑛","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"803"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"153"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Daughter of a devout family, the ever cheerful Akira lives alone on the property of a small yet sacred Shinto shrine. Akira’s energetic liveliness is contagious to those around her, with an innocent personality that makes befriending the girl second nature. Due to her residence, Akira spends much of her time practicing the habits and traditions of a miko shrine maiden, including performance of requisite ceremonies and holiday festivals."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Nargrakhan's review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c555"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【クラスメイトの巫女さん】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悠が子供のころに一緒に遊んだ神社の娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"現在は神社の巫女兼管理人として、一人で暮らしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつもニコニコして楽しげな雰囲気。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"親友の一葉といることが多い。時に彼女に叱られることも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"記憶力がよくて、昔の細かいことを憶えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「きっと好きになるよ、そんな気がするの」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19234","sourceWorkId":"9854","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"本作女主角之一，当地神社的女巫，悠的同班同学，是个非常开朗活力十足的少女，绝大部分的时间脸上都保持着微笑，也因此有时候让人搞不懂心里在想什么。小时候和悠在神社的山林间玩过，当神主的祖父过世后代替其职位，和渚一叶是关系非常亲昵的朋友，经常当一叶拉中提琴时的听众，但每次都会睡着。有着不输给一般人的力气，运动方面也很擅长。养著一只名为“师匠”的猫。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"14329"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/28/287e257a034996145d4943c5079a9dbd62ab78285e122069aa5db8280c86fd3e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/90/9011b1ffb1bc21dd5eac691500159bd07a185faf2fbcce857a3fb6c42f919ac6.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"月城 真菜","creatorId":"vndb:s650","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s650","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s650","name":"鮎川ひなた","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:15398","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c556","characterName":"渚 一葉","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"14331","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"2388"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19236"],"vndbCharacterId":"c556"},"originalCharacterName":"渚 一葉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"803"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"164"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The stunning daughter of an influential magnate, Kazuha lives a cultured life that some might compare to modern princesses. Sharp-minded and attentive to every detail. As a result of her parent’s constant travels and long-distance liaisons, she learned to be self-sufficient and independent from a young age. Nonetheless, Kazuha does not consider herself superior to others, with a modest nature that’s ever ready to take a subordinate role in teamwork and friendship. She often worries more about the others, especially Akira, than herself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Yosuga no Sora Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c556"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【お嬢様（ツンデレ）】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"地元有力者の娘で才色兼備のお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"瑛の親友で、容赦なくバシバシ突っ込みを入れている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"厳しく育てられたのか、きちんと相手を立てる姿勢があるが、意外と短気。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"瑛に悪影響を与えそうな亮平に対しても容赦がない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヴィオラ奏者でもあるが、聞かせる相手は両親と瑛とネコぐらい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私に出来る事って、本当は無いのかもしれない……」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19236","sourceWorkId":"9854","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"当地议员的女儿，悠的同班同学，每天都搭轿车上下学，途中看到瑛会把她硬拉上车；每天午餐的便当也非常豪华，让周围的人感到惊叹。会演奏中提琴，但长大后不知为何不再喜欢，会拉给瑛听但瑛每次都会睡着。在学校表现非常强气，常常对着常逗弄她的中里亮平与天真的天女目瑛发火，但私底下对天女目瑛非常温柔。与父亲关系有些距离。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"14331"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/54/543576073a64117f51ce2408e66134ba9460a4aa81b4a03a83207c60138ec48c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/78/7824c69bff24815a93fe5239e0dddd99d76d9a8e31b81ddc36e44f50ea9c9a5a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"五行 なずな","creatorId":"vndb:s367","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s367","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s367","name":"小野 涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:15396","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c557","characterName":"乃木坂 初佳","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"14346","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"2388"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19237"],"vndbCharacterId":"c557"},"originalCharacterName":"乃木坂 初佳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1223"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"160"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Motoka is a college student struggling to make ends meet, working as a maid in the Migiwa Household to pay the expenses of tuition. While not ideally suited for household chores, her warm compassion and captivating personality offset these deficiencies. She is best friends with Ifukube Yahiro, a notorious drinker, which makes Motoka’s low tolerance to alcohol a particularly hazardous social issue. Especially since she has a particular fondness for the taste of sake."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Nargrakhan's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c557"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【渚家のメイドさん】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"渚家でお手伝いさんとして働いている地元出身のお姉さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"短大を出て就職に失敗したため、親のコネで口をきいてもらい渚家でお手伝いさんをすることになった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"要領が悪いので、すぐテンパって失敗する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"短大の同級生のやひろ（駄菓子屋の店主）とは仲が良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"たまに、合コンに誘われてやひろと一緒に出かけるが惨敗中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「いっつも上手くいかないのは、ホントに私のせいなのかな？」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19237","sourceWorkId":"9854","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"一叶家任职的女仆，短大毕业期间没能找到工作，通过父母的关系，来到了渚家工作。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为工作时候的女仆装而十分害羞。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"慢性子加上大大咧咧的性格，完全不适合进行细致的工作。因此常常是在工作方面被管家责骂。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"排解压力的方法是，到好友八寻的家中饮酒。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"一直在参加男女搭对的联谊活动，但是每次都是惨败。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然酒量很差，但是却十分贪杯。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"总是装出一副很成熟的样子，但是自身的行为却完全不搭调，只是其自己没有发觉这一点。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"14346"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dcadece628dc1a5e7946c1bba61e898095e75fabe59e69f4adedc68f1ee5ca7f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/dd59fc025955584d996ec9c5a0207081f8d833846192ba2046ddd4a25dbd4c55.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡嶋妙","creatorId":"vndb:s359","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s359","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s359","name":"岡嶋 妙","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:6967:14346:4646:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c560","characterName":"倉永 梢","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"14348","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"2388"},{"characterId":"14348","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"6967"}],"egsCharacterIds":["15263"],"vndbCharacterId":"c560"},"originalCharacterName":"倉永 梢","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"601"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"158"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Representative of Haruka's class, a position of important functions and rights, Kozue has a strong sense of responsibility. Very diligent, she take care of all the work of a class rep and through her shy appearance she seems to fantasize about Haruka due to her crush towards him. Often nicknamed by 'iinchou'. (class rep)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Yosuga no Sora Wikia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c560"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【クラス委員長】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悠たちのクラスの委員長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"問題児の亮平にいつも小言を言うのが日課。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悠は亮平と仲がいいため、一緒に怒られている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まじめで融通がきかないこともあるが、やさしく面倒見はいい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"都会に住んでいた悠の田舎ずれしてないところが気に入っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私は真面目じゃないんです、融通が利かないって言うんです…」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15263","sourceWorkId":"9854","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"悠達のクラス委員長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"責任感が強く、生真面目なせいで、お堅い印象がある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"悠に対しては、いつも気を配って面倒を見てくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"周囲にその事をからかわれると、しおらしく可愛い顔をみせる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"意外と面食いで、都会的な物に憧れている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私は真面目じゃないんです、融通が利かないって言うんです…」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15263","sourceWorkId":"12438","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"春日野悠所在班级的班长。 有着很强的责任感，做事认真，性格刚强。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"总是很关照悠。其实心理喜欢着悠，一旦被周围那这点来开玩笑的话，就会显出很害羞的可爱表情。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"意外地很在意长相，憧憬着都市的生活。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"擅长幻想，在《悠之空》里成为主角之一，和春日野悠有恋爱关系。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"14348"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"158 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15263","sourceWorkId":"12438","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/31/3131d551fc4dad8312ed1ad4b4530b0416500da697854ffc8aff78a2814e9c49.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/7048cec93a5468a9c8d53e6f42a4b3d77a37d89d212e39450341a423524159dd.webp","width":166,"height":200,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"峰岸由香里","creatorId":"vndb:s925","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s925","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s925","name":"峰岸 由香里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:6967:14348:5939:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c561","characterName":"伊福部 やひろ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"14347","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"2388"},{"characterId":"14347","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"6967"}],"egsCharacterIds":["15264"],"vndbCharacterId":"c561"},"originalCharacterName":"伊福部 やひろ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"pending-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1001"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"165"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Best friend of Nogisaka Motoka and proprietor of a family owned candy store, the rogue-looking Yahiro would prefer spending her time sleeping and drinking. In truth, the ill-tempered and sardonic mannerisms hide Yahiro’s true personality: a woman whose past is a field littered with the shattered glass of lost dreams, forgotten promises, and broken romances."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Nargrakhan's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c561"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【駄菓子屋のオーナー】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公達の町にある、近所の駄菓子屋風商店の主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最近引退した祖母から店を受け継いで、やる気のない経営をしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"めんどくさがり屋で、ぶっきらぼう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"東京の一流企業で人間関係に振り回され、やさぐれて帰ってきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"店番がめんどくさいときは瑛に任せて、ネットをしてるか寝てる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「メンドくせぇことに、首突っ込むのはやめたんだよ」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15264","sourceWorkId":"9854","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"初佳の親友。現在祖母が経営してた駄菓子屋の跡取り。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"近所の子供の小遣いで支えられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"めんどくさがり屋でぶっきらぼう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"就職した東京の一流企業でトレンディドラマみたいな人間関係に振り回されて、すっかりやさぐれて帰ってきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"店番がめんどくさいときは瑛に任せて、ネットをしてるか寝てる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「メンドくせぇことに、首突っ込むのはやめたんだよ」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15264","sourceWorkId":"12438","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"乃木坂初佳的好友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"现在，继承了祖母所经营的点心铺。附近孩子们的零花钱是其主要收入。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"十分害怕麻烦，举止也很大条。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本来就职于东京一家一流的企业，但是因为疲于那里如同电视剧中一般的复杂人际关系而辞职回到了老家。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"每到店中生意繁忙的时候，就把店务推给瑛，自己跑去上网或者睡觉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"时常对自家贩卖的点心出手，常常看到她在那里大吃大喝。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"14347"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"165 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15264","sourceWorkId":"12438","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"birthday":[{"comparisonValue":"1001","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c561","value":"1001"},{"comparisonValue":"0110","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15264","value":"1/10"},{"comparisonValue":"0110","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"14347","value":"1月10日"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7f99bdf05e8f71f01cb081bc59e8f6f3f684fd8aa85672d1fcc7580bffc066b0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e2bbe9e6fbdd427941467465b1e497f84965110822aa9ccc5c238338178abadb.webp","width":166,"height":200,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"田中涼子","creatorId":"vndb:s6","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6","name":"田中 涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:6967:14347:4832:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c562","characterName":"中里 亮平","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"14349","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"2388"}],"egsCharacterIds":["19238"],"vndbCharacterId":"c562"},"originalCharacterName":"中里 亮平","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"925"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"175"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"For all his faults and freakish behavior, Ryouhei is the kind of person you can always count on. Carefree and spontaneous, he brands himself as the ultimate ladies man, applying cheesy pickup lines whenever a pretty face draws near. Yet when the situation call for it, Ryouhei can offer profoundly sound advice, with an eye that quickly identifies the root of a problem."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Nargrakhan's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c562"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"【悪友】"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と同じクラスメイト。ただし、留年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"馴れ馴れしく、ノリがよく、いつも軽口を叩いる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"面倒見がいいほうなので、普段は兄的ポジションでみんなを引っ張る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"瑛とは幼馴染で、悪ノリして遊ぶことも。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"失敗ばかりの人生を送っているが、それをおくびにも出さず、飄々と生きる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「自分じゃ、格好いいって思っちゃったハズが……これだよ…」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"19238","sourceWorkId":"9854","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"春日野悠的同班同学，也是第一个好友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自来熟，总是得意忘形地开着玩笑，是个轻浮的人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不过为人很体贴，平时是个如大哥哥般的存在，总是为大家打气。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然一直过着很失败的人生，不过其本人对其毫不在意，仍悠然自得的过活。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"和瑛是青梅竹马，也常常捉弄她。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"因为其名字中的“亮”字和瑛的名字的读音是一样的（都是あきら），所以当他们两人在一起的时候，常被人叫“双亮”。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"14349"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/97b660cba79e1749a91f46db962c7299f1c89ec63119d32247cbce04de242d16.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4a/4a75a827e820e33490abf9dc7972b177d7a7bf123994f4e7c3a654c8a993e281.webp","width":166,"height":200,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中國卓郎","creatorId":"vndb:s1067","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1067","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1067","name":"中國 卓郎","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:6967:14349:4606:1","source":"bangumi"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p522","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:2246","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p522","name":"Sphere","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:12438:2246","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p22348","sour